  lines:
  - speaker: 
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: A storm swept you far from home. Marlo, an old dolphin who guards the Lantern
      Road, told you of the Golden Clam whose light shows every lost fish the way
      back. A bottle from another traveler warned of a lantern-fish in the Open Water,
      and spoke of a lost clownfish named Pip.
